      <activity id="1c3abfb3-fa51-5007-8658-3fdaf5f2d439" activityNameId="c52e88f8-b999-50f8-a741-7afe25305972" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, hard coal ash, 0% water, to residual material landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, hard coal ash, 0% water, to residual material landfill
Inventoried waste contains 100% AT hard coal ash; . waste composition (wet, in ppm): H2O n.a.; O 490560; H n.a.; C n.a.; S 3246.2; N n.a.; P 810.95; B 283.61; Cl 22.663; Br 64.895; F 2.9372; I 4.0388; Ag n.a.; As 12.626; Ba 1620.4; Cd 4.0253; Co 57.252; Cr 73.913; Cu 122.52; Hg 0.085005; Mn 1613; Mo 24.758; Ni 162.66; Pb 323.85; Sb 12.173; Se 8.2715; Sn 88.976; V 324.96; Zn 403.69; Be 16.223; Sc 10.761; Sr 1613.7; Ti 12110; Tl 8.0686; W 8.1741; Si 202890; Fe 56857; Ca 16420; Al 137520; K 16199; Mg 48394; Na 8103.2; Share of carbon in waste that is biogenic 60.4%. ;; UUID: f419fd59-6523-40be-8246-1558fe4d0334
Waste-specific short-term emissions to water from leachate. Long-term emissions from landfill to ground water. 
Location: Technology encountered in Switzerland in 2000. Landfill includes base seal and leachate collection system.
Technology: Swiss residual material landfill for polluted, inorganic waste. With base seal and leachate collection system. Recultivation after closure. 
Time period: Waste composition as given in literature reference, theoretical data or other source. Transfer coefficients from prospective model.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Landfill model based on observed leachate concentrations in literature. Extrapolated to 60'000 years heeding chemical characteristics. Initial waste composition from various literature sources. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f419fd59-6523-40be-8246-1558fe4d0334.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
